CHAPTER.VERS:
And Samuel spoke to all the house of Israel, saying, If you

          {+}
         are returning to Yahweh with all your

          {+}
         heart, then put away the foreign gods and the Ashtaroth from among you

          {+}
        , and direct your

          {+}
         hearts to Yahweh, and serve him only; and he will deliver you

          {+}
         out of the hand of the Philistines.

And Samuel said, Gather all Israel to Mizpah, and I will pray for you

          {+}
         to Yahweh.
